# -- AWAKENED ICHORIUM SWORD
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.title=Ichorium Sword of the Titanslayer
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.title.subtitle=Situationally effective
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.stage.1=[WIP]
kami.research.awakened_ichorium_sword.stage.2=The awakened ichorium sword, dubbed the titanslayer, has the unique ability to attune itself to specific enemy types, granting bonuses when striking attuned enemies.<PAGE>Unattuned<DIV>When not attuned, the awakened sword forgoes foregoes any entity attunement bonus.<BR>Instead all energy within the sword is channeled into the blade, doubling the base damage of the weapon.<PAGE>Mortal's Bane<DIV>A bane to all living creatures, when attuned to motrals, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deals up to 20% of a living entity's maximum hp on every hit.<PAGE>Undead Slayer<DIV>Some might call it a holy sword, but I know better.<BR>When attuned to undeath, the awakened sword bypassses all armor and deals up to 20% of an undead target's maxium health.<PAGE>Dragonslayer<DIV>Legends speak of the greatest warriors who ever lived slaying mighty dragons. While I may not be able to achieve their level of noteriety, the awkanened sword can get me close to achieving their feats.<BR>When attuned to dragons, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deals up to 20% of a dragon's maximum health.<BR>Interestingly, this effect also appears to extend to entities wearing dragon-based armor.<PAGE>Abomination Slayer<DIV>During my studies I have encountered entities that do not fit into any standard categories.<BR>These creatures seem to either be otherworldly Eldritch beings, or Tainted abominations that revel in high-flux environments.<BR>When attuned to abominations, the awakened sword bypasses all armor and deal up to 20% of the target's maximum health.

